        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: رویداد",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "رویداد (ruydâd) — \"an event\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "جشنواره فیلم مهمترین رویداد فرهنگی شهر است. Jashnvâre-ye film mohemtarin ruydâd-e farhangi-ye shahr ast. The film festival is the most important cultural event in the city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A modern word, built on ruy dâdan \"to occur\". Plural ruydâd-hâ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ruydâd is derived from ruy dâdan \"to occur\" (EtymDB): ruy \"face\" with dâd, the past stem of dâdan \"to give\". Both parts are native Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling, explaining and describing at B1."
