            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "این واقعه در یک شب سرد اتفاق افتاد. In vâqe'e dar yek shab-e sard ettefâq oftâd. This incident happened on a cold night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal; broken plural vaqâye'. Often for serious or historic events."
            }
          ]
        },
