              "text": "برگزار کردن (bargozâr kardan) — \"to hold, to organise (an event)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دانشگاه هر سال یک جشنواره برگزار میکند. Dâneshgâh har sâl yek jashnvâre bargozâr mikonad. The university holds a festival every year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present bargozâr mikonad. The event takes râ when it is definite."
            }
          ]
        },
