              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "شرکت کردن (sherkat kardan) — \"to take part, to participate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "صد نفر در مسابقه شرکت کردند. Sad nafar dar mosâbeqe sherkat kardand. A hundred people took part in the competition."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With dar: dar jalase sherkat kard. The noun sherkat alone is \"a company\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "sherkat is borrowed from Arabic shirka (EtymDB lists the Arabic word), usually glossed \"partnership, sharing\". kardan \"to do\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
